        "nobel_worthiness": "Biomolecular condensates introduced a compelling physical mechanism for cellular organization and brought soft-matter concepts into cell biology.",
        "attribution": "Hyman and Brangwynne established the biological phenomenon, with Jülicher providing central physical theory of active and nonequilibrium condensates.",
        "maturity": "The field is highly influential and experimentally active, with a growing mechanistic basis.",
